cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Clienvora SEO Checklist Library
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Amir Ali
    website: https://www.clienvora.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Clienvora/clienvora-seo-checklists"
url: https://www.clienvora.com/checklists/
abstract: >-
  The complete free SEO checklist library from clienvora.com as open data.
  1,637 checks across 101 checklists and 4 disciplines,
  released as a printable PDF, a Google Sheets compatible spreadsheet, a CSV, and a
  JSON catalogue. Every check names the tool that finds the problem and the way to
  confirm the fix landed.
keywords:
  - seo
  - checklist
  - technical seo
  - on-page seo
  - off-page seo
  - local seo
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 2026-10-21
date-released: "2026-10-21"
